# Data
# Sweep outputs are regenerable and large. The per-case relief_set_slim.json files are
# the exception: they are sweep INPUTS (HARNESS_RELIEF_SET) produced by
# select_relief_set.py, so they are tracked via `git add -f` and this rule no longer
# applies to them. A new case needs its own forced add.
results/

